  Join Inner on ((#1:t.b = #4:u.d) AND (#0:t.a = #3:u.a))
    Filter (#1:t.b = 1)
      Get t [#0:t.a #1:t.b #2:t.c]
    Filter (#4:u.d = 2)
      Get u [#3:u.a #4:u.d #5:u.e]
